WHO   — The Awakening — the hero's waking from a hundred-year cryogenic sleep into total amnesia — the game's first moment and its engine: a man with no memory learning a world that is itself an amnesia of its own past
WHAT  — the hero's waking from a hundred-year cryogenic sleep into total amnesia — the game's first moment and its engine: a man with no memory learning a world that is itself an amnesia of its own past
